  "scope": "Simplify two ArithmeticSaturation order arguments using cancellation and positive subtraction",
  "validation": "Paired target and sole tracked Lean direct client WindowInterface builds pass with pinned direct inputs; client output bytes match. Both target and client declaration/type/axiom and default simp/instance reports match; client probes pin both target and client. Direct project provider source/object pairs map to prior receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "The wider project, BusyBeaver, Foundation and Mathlib transitive closure remains cached and was not rebuilt from current source.",
    "The previous BinaryCarry build directly pinned BinaryPopulation cde612… from a source-matched prior build; in this experiment that object was sampled from the current search path only after builds, not pinned contemporaneously. An independently proposed BinaryPopulation change requires a coherent combined replay if adopted.",
    "One shared-load paired timing sample does not establish general performance. Declaration and registration reports do not establish proof-body or all persistent-extension equality.",
    "The initial failed standalone ordering probe and fixed probe are retained but lack complete contemporaneous before/after input and output pin receipts; subsequent paired builds establish the validated result.",
    "Compiled objects are omitted; receipts preserve hashes and first-provider paths, and independent object byte checks require external objects."
  ],
